cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: render-engine
abstract: >-
  render-engine is a config-driven documentary render engine built on Remotion, ElevenLabs, faster-whisper and
  ffmpeg. It voices a script paragraph by paragraph, aligns sentences on the audio, and plans the edit from a written
  editing bible with an automatic pace check, cutting archival footage and scan-verified quoted pages on sentence
  boundaries. It mixes and dubs the soundtrack into the original timing slots and renders resumably in one-minute
  parts with a power and battery guard.
type: software
authors:
